Copyright (c) Waveshare team

Modified Files:
---------------
- src/epd.py (written 2026-10-30 after Waveshare's epd2in13_V4.py)

Changes:
--------
- Reimplemented on spidev and lgpio instead of Waveshare's epdconfig layer
- Kept only the full-panel init, full/fast refresh, clear and deep sleep
- Fast waveform loaded once per full refresh instead of a separate init

